lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLuo Li has a deep passion for gardening, and he has some fame in the community because of this. Shao Qi is the organizer of community activities, and Zhi Hao is the person in charge of the community organization. One day, Shao Qi finds Zhi Hao and proposes to hold a garden party, and also suggests inviting Luo Li to introduce his gardening achievements. Zhi Hao hesitates a bit, but Shao Qi smiles at him and gives him a nod of affirmation. Later, after the party invitation goes out, Luo Li accepts the invitation.\n\n[Question]\nWhat do you think Zhi Hao thinks?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhi Hao feels depressed because he doesn't like Luo Li very much.\nB. Zhi Hao is very happy because he thinks Luo Li's arrival makes the party very successful.\nC. Zhi Hao feels a bit troubled, he admires Luo Li but is not sure if Luo Li wants to participate in the party.\nD. Zhi Hao feels a bit uneasy, he thinks inviting Luo Li might bring bad results.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0015011458323898196,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52abcc2ddb05a7fe2ec97","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452156084,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"771c48eaa73b470a86d400a5653735a9"}